SUMMARY:[Machine Learning][Control & Robotics] L4DC 2027 - Paper submission
  deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Learning for Dynamics and Control\nWebsite: h
 ttps://l4dc2027.control.ee.ethz.ch/home\nSource URL: https://l4dc2027.con
 trol.ee.ethz.ch/author-information\nLocation: Stockholm\, Sweden\nTopics:
  Machine Learning\, Control & Robotics\, System Identification & Data-dri
 ven Dynamics\, Reinforcement Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-ba
 sed\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-30\nNotes: Annual 
 conference at the ML/control interface\, hosted by KTH. The November 13 p
 aper deadline is firm (rechecked 2026-10-30). The site gives only the day
 \; the OpenReview submission form\, open since October 8 and observed liv
 e on 2026-10-30\, closes at 23:59 AoE. Other official days have no cutoff
  hour and use estimated end-of-day AoE timing. Late-breaking results are 
 a separate presentation route whose format is not yet described. Tutorial
  and industrial workshop proposals (January 15) are not tracked. Size is 
 an editorial scale category\, not a verified attendance count.\nScope: Th
 e interface of learning\, dynamics\, control\, and optimization for physi
 cal and dynamical systems. Emphasizes foundations and methods for data-dr
 iven control and dynamical modeling\, including theoretical\, empirical\,
  and applied contributions. Pure pattern recognition without a meaningful
  connection to dynamics or control is not the defining focus.\nAdditional
  topics: Learning Theory & Statistical Foundations\nScope sources (2027):
  https://l4dc2027.control.ee.ethz.ch/home\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://l4dc2027.control.ee.ethz.ch/author-information
